/**
 * @component BpWeChatCustomTabBarStyle
 * @lang zh-CN 微信常驻 custom tabBar 的字面样式适配：视觉值与当前 HIA-uView `u-tabbar` 默认浅色契约一致，但不复制组件运行时或取得路由所有权。
 * @lang en Literal-style adapter for the persistent WeChat custom tab bar: visual values align with the current HIA-uView `u-tabbar` default-light contract, but it copies no component runtime and acquires no routing ownership.
 */

/* <lang><zh-CN>平台 custom-tab-bar 根始终固定并无外边距地占满底边；纯白表面与 1px 浅灰上边框直接衔接页面，同时显式采用与页面相同的思源黑体优先栈。</zh-CN><en>The platform custom-tab-bar root remains fixed and spans the bottom edge without an outer margin; its plain-white surface and 1px light-gray top border directly meet the page while explicitly adopting the same Source Han Sans-first stack.</en></lang> */
.bp-custom-tabbar {
  position: fixed;
  z-index: 30;
  right: 0;
  bottom: 0;
  left: 0;
  display: flex;
  align-items: stretch;
  width: 100%;
  box-sizing: border-box;
  min-height: calc(62px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
  margin: 0;
  padding: 5px 0 calc(5px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
  border-top: 1px solid #dfe5ec;
  background: #ffffff;
  font-family: "Source Han Sans SC", "Noto Sans SC", "Noto Sans CJK SC", sans-serif;
}

/* <lang><zh-CN>每项严格占四分之一宽度，并以 27px 图标、13px 文字和 52px 触控高度构成稳定纵向导航；使用原生 view 可避免微信 button 的灰底、内边距与字号重置。</zh-CN><en>Each item occupies exactly one quarter of the width and forms stable vertical navigation from a 27px icon, 13px text, and a 52px touch height; a native view avoids WeChat button gray surfaces, padding, and font resets.</en></lang> */
.bp-custom-tabbar__item {
  flex: 0 0 25%;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: 2px;
  width: 25%;
  box-sizing: border-box;
  min-width: 0;
  min-height: 52px;
  margin: 0;
  padding: 2px 0 3px;
  border: 0;
  border-radius: 0;
  background: #ffffff;
  color: #27364a;
  font-family: inherit;
  font-size: 13px;
  font-weight: 400;
  line-height: 18px;
}

/* <lang><zh-CN>按压态只降低透明度作为短暂反馈，不生成与设计板不符的持续 pill 或色块。</zh-CN><en>The pressed state only lowers opacity for transient feedback and creates no persistent pill or surface block that conflicts with the design board.</en></lang> */
.bp-custom-tabbar__item--pressed { opacity: 0.68; }

/* <lang><zh-CN>选中态由钴蓝图标、文字与字重共同表达；背景保持白色，不使用 pill。</zh-CN><en>The selected state is expressed by the cobalt icon, label, and weight together; the background remains white and uses no pill.</en></lang> */
.bp-custom-tabbar__item--active {
  background: #ffffff;
  color: #0047ab;
  font-weight: 600;
}

/* <lang><zh-CN>四项统一使用 27px 几何框；81×81 PNG 在微信常用 3x 屏上正好按整数比例呈现，避免此前缩到 24px 造成的非整数重采样模糊。</zh-CN><en>All four items use a 27px geometry box; the 81×81 PNG maps at an exact integer ratio on common WeChat 3x screens, avoiding the non-integer resampling blur caused by the former 24px display size.</en></lang> */
.bp-custom-tabbar__icon {
  display: block;
  flex: none;
  width: 27px;
  height: 27px;
}

/* <lang><zh-CN>单行标签在小屏空间不足时截断，不改变实际 locale 文案。</zh-CN><en>The single-line label truncates when small-screen space is insufficient without changing actual locale copy.</en></lang> */
.bp-custom-tabbar__label {
  display: block;
  max-width: 100%;
  overflow: hidden;
  font-family: inherit;
  font-size: 13px;
  font-weight: inherit;
  line-height: 18px;
  text-overflow: ellipsis;
  white-space: nowrap;
}
